{"resourceIdentifier":"4513","resourceName":"Argentina Gran Chaco Region REDD+ Project","description":"The Project aims to protect the native forest socio-ecosystems of the Argentine Gran Chaco ecoregion. The Grouped Project will seek to reduce planned deforestation and unplanned deforestation and degradation pressures by encouraging landowners granted with large-scale agricultural and livestock production deforestation permits to set aside their land for conservation and forest regeneration. It will also implement a combination of environmental and social activities aimed at improving the livelihoods of community members living in the vicinity of the project area as well as the enhancement of the forest and biodiversity.\r\nIn Argentina, deforestation has accelerated over the past 40 years as the country's agricultural frontier has expanded, resulting in one of the highest deforestation rates in the world. This expansion of the agricultural frontier is having a major impact on native ecosystems and their biodiversity. At the same time, deforestation and land enclosure have altered the livelihoods of many indigenous and/or peasant communities who use large areas of the Forest for their activities.\r\nFor the first Project Activity Instance the project proponent, VISTA Energy, purchased part of the El Chaguaral farm (4.892 hectares) in the current boundary of the agricultural frontier. The former owner of the property had a clearing permit to transform the land for agricultural and livestock purposes. VISTA will not make use of that permit. The activities to achieve this include fencing, hiring responsible field staff to monitor the property, and developing and implementing a biodiversity conservation plan together with an action plan for fire prevention, warning and response will be implemented. Also assisted natural regeneration and enrichment planting activities will be implemented.The initial activity instance is estimated to generate ≈ 983,460 tCO2e net GHG emissions reductions and removals (≈49,173. tCO2 e per year for 20 years)","location":{"latitude":-23.937426,"longitude":-63.761796},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-06-04","endExclusive":"2025-07-05","endInclusive":"2025-07-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4513"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Northeast Argentina"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Vista Energy Argentina SAU"},{"type":"string","value":"Buenos Aires, Argentina"},{"type":"string","value":"+5491161037034"},{"type":"string","value":"florencia.groba@vistaenergy.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"33035"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4892 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"03/02/2026"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 21/12/2022 - 20/12/2062"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Vista Energy Argentina SAU"},{"type":"string","value":"Buenos Aires, Argentina"},{"type":"string","value":"+5491161037034"},{"type":"string","value":"florencia.groba@vistaenergy.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Under validation"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"33035"}]},{"code":"PR